      "camera": {
        "position": [3.5, 1.2, 14],
        "target": [3.5, 1.2, 0]
      },
      "markdown": "## The monotonic deque\n\nKeep a {{glossary:deque}} of **indices**. Before pushing index $i$:\n\n1. pop the **front** if it has left the window ($\\text{front} \\le i - k$);\n2. pop the **back** while its value is $\\le$ `nums[i]` — it can never be a maximum again.\n\nThis keeps a {{glossary:monotonic deque}}: values decrease from front to back, so the front is always the window maximum. Blue dots mark the indices currently in the deque.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "axis",
          "type": "line",
          "points": [
            [-0.7, 0, 0],
            [7.7, 0, 0]
          ],
          "color": "#55605a",
          "width": 2
        },
